Use the score counter: `score % 3 === 0` is true after 3, 6, 9… food items.

Inside the food-eaten block, replace the empty condition:

```js
if (score % 3 === 0) {
    clearInterval(interval);
    interval = setInterval(moveSnake, 150);
}
```

`150` means the snake moves every 150 ms. To progressively increase speed, store the delay in a variable:

```js
let moveDelay = 200;
```

Then every three food items:

```js
moveDelay -= 20;
clearInterval(interval);
interval = setInterval(moveSnake, moveDelay);
```

Remember to reset `moveDelay` in `restartGame()`. Also ensure the delay never becomes too small, for example by using `Math.max(50, moveDelay - 20)`.

